n="00:25.173" end="00:28.235"><span begin="00:25.173" end="00:25.422">Cause </span><span begin="00:25.422" end="00:25.800">I'll </span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:26.046">never </span><span begin="00:26.046" end="00:26.420">take </span><span begin="00:26.420" end="00:26.673">them </span><span begin="00:26.673" end="00:28.235">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.235" end="00:31.923"><span begin="00:28.235" end="00:28.860">There's </span><span begin="00:28.860" end="00:29.297">no </span><span begin="00:29.297" end="00:29.609">turning </span><span begin="00:29.609" end="00:31.923">back </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.923" end="00:34.231"><span begin="00:31.923" end="00:32.417">It's </span><span begin="00:32.417" end="00:32.731">for </span><span begin="00:32.731" end="00:33.048">the </span><span begin="00:33.048" end="00:34.231">better</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.231" end="00:38.048"><span begin="00:34.231" end="00:34.610">Baby </span><span begin="00:34.610" end="00:35.107">I </span><span begin="00:35.107" end="00:35.733">deserve </span><span begin="00:35.733" end="00:36.235">more </span><span begin="00:36.235" end="00:36.798">then </span><span begin="00:36.798" end="00:37.235">empty </span><span begin="00:37.235" end="00:38.048">words</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.048" end="00:39.235"><span begin="00:38.048" end="00:38.417">And </span><span begin="00:38.417" end="00:39.235">promises</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.235" end="00:42.673"><span begin="00:39.235" end="00:39.735">I </span><span begin="00:39.735" end="00:40.423">believed </span><span begin="00:40.423" end="00:40.983">every </span><span begin="00:40.983" end="00:41.607">thing </span><span begin="00:41.607" end="00:42.047">you </span><span begin="00:42.047" end="00:42.673">said </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.673" end="00:46.859"><span begin="00:42.673" end="00:43.048">And </span><span begin="00:43.048" end="00:43.421">I </span><span begin="00:43.421" end="00:43.671">gave </span><span begin="00:43.671" end="00:43.981">you </span><span begin="00:43.981" end="00:44.235">the </span><span begin="00:44.235" end="00:44.548">best </span><span begin="00:44.548" end="00:44.795">I </span><span begin="00:44.795" end="00:46.859">had</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.859" end="00:49.361"><span begin="00:46.859" end="00:47.423">So </span><span begin="00:47.423" end="00:47.736">take </span><span begin="00:47.736" end="00:48.671">a </span><span begin="00:48.671" end="00:49.361">bow </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.361" end="00:53.795"><span begin="00:49.361" end="00:49.799">'Cause </span><span begin="00:49.799" end="00:50.297">you've </span><span begin="00:50.297" end="00:50.547">taken </span><span begin="00:50.547" end="00:51.047">everything </span><span begin="00:51.047" end="00:53.795">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.795" end="00:55.548"><span begin="00:53.795" end="00:54.359">You </span><span begin="00:54.359" end="00:54.736">played </span><span begin="00:54.736" end="00:55.109">the </span><span begin="00:55.109" end="00:55.548">part </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.548" end="01:00.361"><span begin="00:55.548" end="00:55.859">Like </span><span begin="00:55.859" end="00:56.173">a </span><span begin="00:56.173" end="00:56.486">star </span><span begin="00:56.486" end="00:56.798">you </span><span begin="00:56.798" end="00:57.047">played </span><span begin="00:57.047" end="00:57.547">it </span><span begin="00:57.547" end="00:57.923">so </span><span begin="00:57.923" end="01:00.361">well</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.361" end="01:02.049"><span begin="01:00.361" end="01:00.799">Take </span><span begin="01:00.799" end="01:01.236">a </span><span begin="01:01.236" end="01:02.049">bow </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.049" end="01:06.674"><span begin="01:02.049" end="01:02.423">'Cause </span><span begin="01:02.423" end="01:02.795">the </span><span begin="01:02.795" end="01:03.111">scene </span><span begin="01:03.111" end="01:03.424">is </span><span begin="01:03.424" end="01:03.735">coming </span><span begin="01:03.735" end="01:04.049">to </span><span begin="01:04.049" end="01:04.299">an </span><span begin="01:04.299" end="01:06.674">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.674" end="01:08.674"><span begin="01:06.674" end="01:07.174">I </span><span begin="01:07.174" end="01:07.799">gave </span><span begin="01:07.799" end="01:08.237">you </span><span begin="01:08.237" end="01:08.674">love </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.674" end="01:11.669"><span begin="01:08.674" end="01:08.923">All </span><span begin="01:08.923" end="01:09.173">you </span><span begin="01:09.173" end="01:09.424">gave </span><span begin="01:09.424" end="01:09.674">me </span><span begin="01:09.674" end="01:10.299">was </span><span begin="01:10.299" end="01:11.669">pretend </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.669" end="01:21.920"><span begin="01:11.669" end="01:12.047">So </span><span begin="01:12.047" end="01:12.981">now </span><span begin="01:12.981" end="01:13.673">take </span><span begin="01:13.673" end="01:14.109">a </span><span begin="01:14.109" end="01:21.920">bow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.920" end="01:25.670"><span begin="01:21.920" end="01:22.487">The </span><span begin="01:22.487" end="01:22.924">future's </span><span begin="01:22.924" end="01:23.298">about </span><span begin="01:23.298" end="01:23.549">to </span><span begin="01:23.549" end="01:25.670">change </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.670" end="01:27.798"><span begin="01:25.670" end="01:26.175">Before </span><span begin="01:26.175" end="01:26.670">you </span><span begin="01:26.670" end="01:26.984">know </span><span begin="01:26.984" end="01:27.798">it </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.798" end="01:29.487"><span begin="01:27.798" end="01:28.296">The </span><span begin="01:28.296" end="01:28.546">curtain </span><span begin="01:28.546" end="01:29.487">closes </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.487" end="01:31.298"><span begin="01:29.487" end="01:29.924">Take </span><span begin="01:29.924" end="01:30.236">a </span><span begin="01:30.236" end="01:30.610">look </span><span begin="01:30.610" end="01:31.298">around </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.298" end="01:34.612"><span begin="01:31.298" end="01:31.674">There's </span><span begin="01:31.674" end="01:32.110">no </span><span begin="01:32.110" end="01:32.546">one </span><span begin="01:32.546" end="01:32.858">in </span><span begin="01:32.858" end="01:33.175">the </span><span begin="01:33.175" end="01:34.612">crowd </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.612" end="01:38.732"><span begin="01:34.612" end="01:35.046">I'm </span><span begin="01:35.046" end="01:35.487">throwing </span><span begin="01:35.487" end="01:35.799">away </span><span begin="01:35.799" end="01:36.172">the </span><span begin="01:36.172" end="01:38.732">pain </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.732" end="01:40.736"><span begin="01:38.732" end="01:39.110">And </span><span begin="01:39.110" end="01:39.422">you </span><span begin="01:39.422" end="01:40.112">should </span><span begin="01:40.112" end="01:40.736">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.736" end="01:42.422"><span begin="01:40.736" end="01:41.050">That </span><span begin="01:41.050" end="01:41.675">your </span><span begin="01:41.675" end="01:42.422">preformanc</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.422" end="01:45.425"><span begin="01:42.422" end="01:42.800">Made </span><span begin="01:42.800" end="01:43.238">me </span><span begin="01:43.238" end="01:43.612">strong </span><span begin="01:43.612" end="01:45.425">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.425" end="01:47.234"><span begin="01:45.425" end="01:45.734">So </span><span begin="01:45.734" end="01:46.108">take </span><span begin="01:46.108" end="01:46.420">a </span><span begin="01:46.420" end="01:47.234">bow </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.234" e